          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "None rero, ko turi uruvyaro rwayo, ntidukwiye kwiyumvira ko Imana imeze nk’igishushanyo gikozwe mu nzahabu, mw’ifeza canke mw’ibuye, biciye mu buhinga n’amaboko vy’abantu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ibihe abantu batari bwamenye Imana, iyo Mana nta co ibibagirizako, ariko ubu ihamagarira abantu bose aho bari hose kwihana, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kuko yashinze umusi izocira imanza isi mu bugororotsi, ikoresheje umuntu yagenye. Ivyo Imana yabigaragaje mu maso ya bose mu kumuzura imukuye mu bapfuye.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
